Just a short note for those who are not familiar.
There is a conlangery website featuring regular podcasts that can be 
downloaded as mp3 files.
http://conlangery.com/about-conlangery/episode-list/ 

Episode #42<http://conlangery.com/2012/03/19/conlangery-42-practicum-getting-rid-of-adjectives/>is about Lojban.
The full list of episodes is a good starting place for searching for 
solutions of problems that we face in Lojban.

I listened to some episodes and already found several ideas to implement in 
lojban.

